2026-10-02  Matevz Tadel  <matevz.tadel@ijs.si>

	* *.C:
	Ported the macros to namespace gled.  They include the setup macros
	(sun.C, sun_demos.C, eye.C) instead of loading them at run time, load
	the lib-sets with #pragma cling load and have using namespace gled.
	Removed the forward declarations of gled classes.

	* EvDisp.root:
	* alice_simple.C:
	* alice_geom.C:
	Removed EvDisp.root.  It held the selection of detector volumes in the
	old ZGlass layout, which the current classes cannot read.  alice_simple.C
	now imports the volumes of the geometry directly, three levels deep.
	alice_geom.C saves and loads its test node with geoview.root.

	* alice_geom.C:
	* alice_simple.C:
	Declared the helper functions before their use.

	* common_foos.C:
	Included gled_globals.C and loaded Geom1 and RootGeo.  Made the string
	variables const.  Passed ZRnrModBase::O_On instead of 1 to the
	operation setters.

